WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.041 --> 00:00:05.748
Father hugged Beauty. "We're saved!

2
00:00:05.749 --> 00:00:10.428
All that fine red cloth will make us rich.

3
00:00:10.429 --> 00:00:12.514
I'll pay my bills.

4
00:00:12.515 --> 00:00:16.813
Then I'll open a new shop."

5
00:00:16.814 --> 00:00:20.602
Father saw Beauty staring at him.

6
00:00:20.603 --> 00:00:23.986
"What's wrong?" he asked.

7
00:00:23.987 --> 00:00:27.395
"I thought you would be happy."

8
00:00:27.396 --> 00:00:31.569
"How do you know the ship came in?" Beauty asked.

9
00:00:31.570 --> 00:00:34.344
"You said it sunk."

10
00:00:34.345 --> 00:00:38.493
"I heard men talking," Father said.

11
00:00:38.494 --> 00:00:42.460
"They were on their way back from town."

12
00:00:42.461 --> 00:00:47.274
"That's wonderful news," Beauty said.

13
00:00:47.275 --> 00:00:49.453
She hugged Father.

14
00:00:49.454 --> 00:00:53.993
"She's so good and kind," he thought.

15
00:00:53.994 --> 00:00:57.930
"I'll never let her down again."

16
00:00:57.931 --> 00:01:00.840
Father began making plans.

17
00:01:00.841 --> 00:01:03.825
"I'm going to the dock right away.

18
00:01:03.826 --> 00:01:06.521
Then I'll go to town.

19
00:01:06.522 --> 00:01:12.635
Don't worry—everything will be fine now."

20
00:01:12.636 --> 00:01:21.121
Beauty hurried to get his hat.

21
00:01:21.122 --> 00:01:24.414
Father held her hands tightly.

22
00:01:24.415 --> 00:01:31.000
"Promise me you'll stay out of the forest."

23
00:01:31.001 --> 00:01:36.410
Beauty nodded. "I promise."

24
00:01:36.411 --> 00:01:42.859
Father waved good-bye and hurried off.

25
00:01:42.860 --> 00:01:52.734
At the dock he saw the ship.

26
00:01:52.735 --> 00:01:59.074
Father waved to the captain.

27
00:01:59.075 --> 00:02:01.973
"I heard your ship sank.

28
00:02:01.974 --> 00:02:06.274
But here you are."

29
00:02:06.275 --> 00:02:12.707
The captain nodded. "I heard the forest monster ate you.

30
00:02:12.708 --> 00:02:15.999
And here you are."

31
00:02:16.000 --> 00:02:22.011
"I'm glad we are both well," Father said.

32
00:02:22.012 --> 00:02:26.234
"Now it's time for me to pay what I owe."

33
00:02:26.235 --> 00:02:31.392
He glanced at the ship's deck.

34
00:02:31.393 --> 00:02:35.730
"Where's all my cloth?"

35
00:02:35.731 --> 00:02:40.231
The captain handed Father a square of folded cloth.

36
00:02:40.232 --> 00:02:43.209
"This is all that's left."

37
00:02:43.210 --> 00:02:49.725
Father blinked in surprise. "Where's the rest of it?"

38
00:02:49.726 --> 00:02:53.320
"The sheriff took it," the captain said.

39
00:02:53.321 --> 00:02:56.391
"He used it to pay your bills.

40
00:02:56.392 --> 00:02:59.521
I heard he sold the rest of it."

41
00:02:59.522 --> 00:03:03.715
"But . . ." Father's legs shook.

42
00:03:03.716 --> 00:03:08.334
"But the cloth belongs to me!"

43
00:03:08.335 --> 00:03:10.490
The captain shrugged.

44
00:03:10.491 --> 00:03:19.898
"Everyone thought you were dead."

